{"id":"chagrin","lemma":"chagrin","pos":"adj","rank":2667,"glosses":["despondent, woeful","disgruntled, morose"],"ipa":"/ʃa.ɡʁɛ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/56/Fr-chagrin.ogg/Fr-chagrin.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"chagrine","masculinePlural":"chagrins","femininePlural":"chagrines"},"formAudio":{"chagrins":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0b/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-chagrins.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Oublie tes chagrins.","en":"Forget your sorrows.","words":[{"g":"to forget","l":"oublier"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Mon cœur était rempli de chagrin.","en":"My heart was filled with sorrow.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"heart"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"filled"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Le chagrin la rendit folle.","en":"Grief drove her mad.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"to return","l":"rendre"},{"g":"crazy, mad","l":"fou"}]},{"text":"Les nouvelles l'emplirent de chagrin.","en":"The news filled her with sorrow.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"news"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Le travail est le meilleur antidote au chagrin.","en":"Work is the best antidote to sorrow.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"work"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"best, better"},{"g":"antidote"},{"g":"to the"},null]}]}